  "sourceTitle": "Sugar Free Frozen Dessert",
  "sourceText": "Sugar Free Frozen Dessert\nBy: Carrie Barr\nPublished: Sunday, December 6, 2009 - 12:08am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 cups buttermilk\n8 slices pineapple\n8 tablespoons juice (no sugar added)\n5 teaspoons sugar substitute\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend together in blender til smooth. Freeze into 4 portions.\n\nAbout\n\n\nDon't let the buttermilk fool you. This is great.",
